+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to evict cache entries using a Least Recently Used (LRU) policy, with each entry expiring after a time-to-live (TTL) of 300 seconds. LRU discards the least recently accessed entries first, and the 300-second TTL bounds how stale any cached entry can become.
